<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1">
  <Itf Name="ICyclicNode" Id="{81cb4cf7-87b9-41f2-a63f-f0a7f4c7ec45}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This interface extends the INode interface with a run method for a cyclically update/monitoring.
Examples for cyclic nodes are device drivers, meausurements or communication nodes (MES / other PLC / etc.)

